    <briefdescription>
<para>a mersenne-twister based random number generator </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This random number generator provides various distribution of random numbers being specific to the SystemC process invoking the generator function. This makes the generator independent of the order of invocation in a delta cycle and allows to replay with the same seed </para>
    </detaileddescription>
